{"unit_id":"ddssh__dsh-joplin#card-zh","repo":"ddssh/dsh-joplin","commit":"5691e32f9daff9ff760701ff17029943d0747c2f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-joplin 是把本机 Joplin 笔记接入 DSH 的 Host 插件，通过注册工具调用 Joplin 桌面端的 Web Clipper API。它可检查连接状态、浏览笔记本、搜索笔记并读取正文，也能创建笔记、笔记本、导入 Markdown 文件，以及查找笔记之间的出链和反向链接；搜索接口异常时可退回本地扫描。适合希望在 DSH 会话中检索或整理个人 Joplin 笔记的用户。需要运行中的 Joplin 桌面端、启用 Web Clipper 服务并配置 API token，默认服务地址为本机 41184 端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:141-147","joplin-tools.js:736-742","joplin-tools.js:804-909","joplin-tools.js:911-962","joplin-tools.js:1170-1241","joplin-client.js:17-24"]}
{"unit_id":"ddssh__dsh-joplin#card-en","repo":"ddssh/dsh-joplin","commit":"5691e32f9daff9ff760701ff17029943d0747c2f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-joplin connects DSH to the local Joplin Web Clipper API. Tools browse notebooks, search and read notes, create notebooks and notes, import Markdown, and find linked notes. Search supports local-scan fallback. Requires Joplin desktop, Web Clipper, and an API token; default is localhost:41184.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:141-147","joplin-tools.js:736-742","joplin-tools.js:804-909","joplin-tools.js:911-962","joplin-tools.js:1170-1241","joplin-client.js:17-24"]}
